+/**
+ * Main stream / Substream settings pages.
+ *
+ * The page edits a whole stream and applies it as one request. The camera
+ * writes the settings to /etc/raptor.conf and restarts the video stack, which
+ * takes a few seconds and makes RTSP clients reconnect; nothing applies until
+ * Apply is pressed.
+ *
+ * Which values each menu offers comes from the camera profile
+ * (GET /api/v1/settings/streams/options), so one page serves every camera
+ * series. A menu with no choices configured shows the current value only.
+ * A change that would not fit the video memory (MMA) is refused here before
+ * anything is sent, and again on the camera.
+ */
